Since Anki's so open source, why come we don't just take a shot at a plugin
https://github.com/dae/ankiplugins

<https://github.com/dae/ankiplugins>Fork it! The request is for an algortihm
that chooses good 'distractors' to make the multiple choice harder. It seems
to me that at least getting a random set of distractors should be effective
enough and pretty simple... who's good with Python?

